!.vscode/launch.json
*.iml
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.gradle/
out/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

.codex/worktrees/

# =====================================================================
# world-as-data structure
#
# source/   irreplaceable authoring files: Gaea project, GIMP working
#           files, heightmaps. Large and partly licence-bound. Lives
#           OUTSIDE this repo; see data/notes/source_tree.md. The path is
#           set per machine via COBBLERS_SOURCE_ROOT and the canonical
#           heightmap is pinned by sha256 in data/world.json.
# derived/  generated from source + data + tools. Disposable.
# build/    datapack, world and server output. Disposable.
#
# data/ and kits/ are the authored product and are always tracked.
# =====================================================================
/source/
/derived/*
!/derived/README.md
/build/*
!/build/README.md

# Experiment runtimes and captured runs: server installs, worlds, logs.
# Multi-gigabyte and reproducible from the manifests.
experiments/*/runtime/
experiments/*/runs/*/
